    "longDesc": "Quality You Can Trust: Bluebird Face Paints are formulated from premium ingredients, ensuring full coverage, vibrant hues, and long-lasting wear. Safe for All Ages: Our face paints are hypoallergenic, paraben-free, and non-toxic, making them safe for the sensitive skin of both adults and children. Vibrant Primary Colours: The set includes six essential primary colours – red, yellow, blue, green, white, and black. Mix and match to create your perfect shade. Easy Application &amp; Removal: These paints glide smoothly onto the skin for easy application and can be simply removed with soap and water, leaving no residue. Versatile Use: Ideal for birthday parties, Halloween, carnivals, stage performances, or just an afternoon of fun. Safety Information: Always perform a patch test on a small area of skin before full application. If any irritation occurs, discontinue use immediately. Do not use on broken or irritated skin. Avoid contact with eyes and mouth. Age Recommendation: 3 years and up",
